This one's Jenna's,
she's been, oh she got,

00:24:07.463 --> 00:24:09.880
there's a lot of things,
got her number in there.

00:24:09.880 --> 00:24:12.070
Got the GMM logo on one.
E-mail just in case

00:24:12.070 --> 00:24:13.180
it's lost.

